# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` (this machine's setting) checks out CRLF while
# the upstream commits LF, so `git merge` sees every line of a file as changed and
# reports a whole-file conflict instead of the handful of real hunks. That turns a
# merge with three real conflicts into one with none of them visible.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary artifacts and generated bundles keep whatever bytes they have.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text
*.zip binary
*.bundle binary
